# shell: tracker
# CW-021/CW-022: the single-window shell presents the shared File menu.
wait 8
note File opens from the tracker window's menu bar
click 20 35
wait 3
expect-menu Find
note the open menu invokes the existing new-folder command
menu-pick New folder
wait 8
expect-file /tmp/trk_script/New folder
note Attributes is a live list-only menu, not a painted label
click 130 35
wait 3
expect-menu Permissions
menu-pick Kind
wait 4
expect-columns 3
note Window exposes the shared view-mode inventory
click 65 35
wait 3
expect-menu List view
menu-pick Mini icon view
wait 4
quit
